    "title": "📅 Art Nurtures opening reception with shuttle on Sept 27",
    "text": "21 hours ago 📅 Art Nurtures opening reception with shuttle service\nThe Arts Council of Livingston is hosting the Opening Reception for Art Nurtures on Sunday, September 27, 2026, from 1:00–4:00 p.m. at the ACL Gallery, 240 South Livingston Avenue, Livingston, NJ 07039 .\nThis group show features fine work by local artists in many media, including fabric, glass, oil paint, watercolor, sculpture, and more .\nFor easier parking, a van/jitney will shuttle guests between the Trinity Church parking lot, 343 East Cedar Street , and the ACL Gallery.\nRegular gallery hours during the exhibition are:\nFridays: 3:00–7:00 p.m. Saturdays & Sundays: 1:00–4:00 p.m. Art Nurtures will be on view until November 1.\nMore Info: Calendar • ACL Opening Reception - Art Nurtures\nThis article includes content summarized and organized with AI tools, which can make mistakes. Learn more.",
    "summary": "21 hours ago 📅 Art Nurtures opening reception with shuttle service The Arts Council of Livingston is hosting the Opening Reception for Art Nurtures on Sunday, September 27, 2026, from 1:00–4:00 p.m. at the ACL Gallery, 240 South Livingston Avenue, Livingston, NJ 07039 . This group show features fine work by local artists in many media, including fabric, glass, oil paint, watercolor, sculpture, and more . For easier parking, a van/jitney will shuttle guests between the Trinity Church parking lot, 343 East Cedar Street , and the ACL Gallery.",
